OL,4,BF1 bosses agree V8 engines deal from   
OL,5,B2030                                   
OL,6,GFormula 1 bosses have reached a deal   
OL,7,Gthat means V8 turbo hybrid engines     
OL,8,Gwill replace the current controversial 
OL,9,Gunits in 2030.                         
OL,11,FA statement from governing body the    
OL,12,FFIA on Friday said that all F1's power-
OL,13,Funit manufacturers had "committed" to  
OL,14,Fa proposal for a 2.1-litre V8 turbo    
OL,15,Fengine with a smaller electrical       
OL,16,Felement than this year.                
OL,18,FPlans for this specific engine, and    
OL,19,Fits associated turbo and hybrid        
OL,20,Farchitecture were first revealed by    
OL,21,FBBC Sport last month.                  
